15. Find First and Last Transaction Per Customer

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.window import Window
from pyspark.sql.functions import first,last

w = Window.partitionBy("customer_id") \
          .orderBy("txn_date")

df.withColumn(
    "first_txn",
    first("txn_date").over(w)
)

SQL:

SELECT customer_id,
       MIN(txn_date) first_txn,
       MAX(txn_date) last_txn
FROM transactions
GROUP BY customer_id;
